":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"French, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"O6kMCxp8r9mKyFZy7sTxlg","review_id":"0V8ziIscApNGGcv5Qz7wLA","date":"2014-04-28T21:44:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9512612819671631,"text_excerpt":"Had a great time with family and friends there last week. Ambiance and décor was the beauty we expected. The little bar happy hour was fun before we ate. All the food was great. Service was good. We weren't rushed or hovered over. Valet in the French quarter made it so easy. I'd recommend Marti's to any New Orleanian who knows a good restaurant from not."},{"business_id":"O6kMCxp8r9mKyFZy7sTxlg","review_id":"blknE_vm3ByMD4ptDmSfew","date":"2014-11-17T23:31:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9190988540649414,"text_excerpt":"In a city famous for food and passionate about its \"old school\" restaurants, the re-opening on Marti's on Rampart Street in the French Quarter was eagerly anticipated by us native Denizens of the Quarter.... We are not disappointed. The decor is traditional New Orleans... A bit over the top, but in an elegant way. The service is some of the best I've had in the city.... Really Emeril's and the Brennan restaurants are hard to beat in this regard.... And the food was WONDERFUL!!! There is some serious attention to detail... Some new twists to traditional ingredients and scattered throughout the menu are standards like Trout Almondine. If you want to experience the rebirth of a great New Orl..."},{"business_id":"O6kMCxp8r9mKyFZy7sTxlg","review_id":"8H8uT_BwnB1t5BWzboiFMQ","date":"2015-05-21T15:59:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9189163446426392,"text_excerpt":"As a fan of this building's previous restaurant, Peristyle, I selfishly miss Peristyle but Marti's is a fantastic addition to this neighborhood. The restaurant looks very much the same and has the menu of a French Brassiere. The dimly lit bar is a perfect place to sample their mixologist's creations before dinner or even a place to enjoy a more quaint, romantic dinner. Highly recommend the plateau fruits de mer, duck confit, and the scallops!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"O6kMCxp8r9mKyFZy7sTxlg","photo_id":"7F3-gFRQZBeAdh0sc1Uy9g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7F3-gFRQZBeAdh0sc1Uy9g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9045999646186829},{"business_id":"O6kMCxp8r9mKyFZy7sTxlg","photo_id":"Ab3EOEFXHT5VUGDoujXWcQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Ab3EOEFXHT5VUGDoujXWcQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.878469705581665},{"business_id":"O6kMCxp8r9mKyFZy7sTxlg","photo_id":"qCtyPi9FKsDS6JkpmzfSxQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qCtyPi9FKsDS6JkpmzfSxQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8773521780967712},{"business_id":"O6kMCxp8r9mKyFZy7sTxlg","photo_id":"J55VDESZBKJ34Fxanw5bDQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/J55VDESZBKJ34Fxanw5bDQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8732529282569885},{"business_id":"O6kMCxp8r9mKyFZy7sTxlg","photo_id":"EkCEdXN7d7obgdxGcDhp0w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EkCEdXN7d7obgdxGcDhp0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8480690717697144}]},"notebook_case":null}
